00:05:07.710 --> 00:05:11.470
If you've been following this, you're reacting
to me saying, yeah, David, we know that a

00:05:11.470 --> 00:05:13.669
lot of people didn't know this

00:05:13.669 --> 00:05:19.460
director mother, the president has repeatedly
