00:05:23.629 --> 00:05:25.960
But that is not what your report said.

00:05:25.960 --> 00:05:27.050
Is it correct?

00:05:27.050 --> 00:05:28.310
That is not what the report said.

00:05:28.310 --> 00:05:34.210
And now reading from page two of volume two
of your report that's on the screen, you wrote

00:05:34.210 --> 00:05:40.240
quote, if we had confidence after a thorough
investigation of the facts that the president

00:05:40.240 --> 00:05:46.409
